  <li class="project-list__item">
    <h2 class="project-list__title">A nonadaptive explanation for complex multicellularity in eukaryotes | 2024</h2>
    <div class="project-list__body">
      <img class="project-list__img" src="/img/nonadaptive.jpg" alt="Nonadaptive explanation for complex multicellularity in eukaryotes">
      <div class="project-list__text">
        <p>In collaboration with one of my PhD advisors, Will Ratcliff, I wrote
        a simulation to demonstrate a hypothesis about why complex multicellularity
        has arisen multiple times in eukaryotes but not in prokaryotes.</p>

        <p><a href="https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2319840121" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the paper →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </li>

